TITLE:: SPHealth
summary:: what only shows over time: synths that pile up, outlive their kind, or are left paused
categories:: Libraries>ServerPanel
related:: Classes/SPTree, Classes/SPRouting

DESCRIPTION::
The problems of link::Classes/SPTree:: that one look at the tree can not find. Language only; SPTree calls link::#-check:: at every answer of the server.

list::
## strong::piling up:: - a SynthDef's count, sampled every link::#*sampleEvery:: seconds, has never gone down over at least five samples and has grown by six, and by a quarter.
## strong::outlives its kind:: - the synths of a def that ended lived a few seconds at most, and one has been there link::#*outlives:: times as long (and link::#*outlivesAtLeast:: seconds).
## strong::left paused:: - a synth paused for more than link::#*pausedFor:: seconds beside a running one of the same def, in the same group, on the same busses: released while asleep and never freed, as SuperDirt's sleeping effects are.
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
A new one, with no history.

METHOD:: sampleEvery
Seconds between two counts: 5.

METHOD:: samples
How many counts are kept: 12, a minute.

METHOD:: pausedFor
Seconds a synth is paused before it can be called left behind: 20.

METHOD:: outlives
How many times the usual life makes an outlier: 20.

METHOD:: outlivesAtLeast
And at least this many seconds: 30.

METHOD:: signature
A synth's busses as a list that two synths on the same busses share.
ARGUMENT:: ios
From link::Classes/SPRouting#*iosOf::.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: check
Look at the tree now.
ARGUMENT:: order
The running synths, node Events, in tree order.
ARGUMENT:: known
What is known of each by id: an Event with code::born::.
ARGUMENT:: history
The ended synths: Events with code::def::, code::born::, code::ended::.
ARGUMENT:: paused
The paused synths: id -> since when.
ARGUMENT:: ios
Each synth's busses by id.
ARGUMENT:: now
The time; code::Main.elapsedTime:: when nil.
RETURNS:: an Array of problems, Events code::(level:, kind:, id:, def:, text:, key:)::

METHOD:: problems
What the last link::#-check:: found.

METHOD:: countsOf
A def's counts, oldest first.
ARGUMENT:: def
A SynthDef's name.
